\",\"content\":\"Why first-person video changes what robots can learn\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"5\",{\"property\":\"og:description\",\"content\":\"A practical look at why viewpoint, intent, and task structure matter when human activity becomes training data for embodied systems.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"6\",{\"property\":\"og:url\",\"content\":\"https://digirobotics.xyz/blog/first-person-video-robot-learning\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"property\":\"og:type\",\"content\":\"article\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"property\":\"article:published_time\",\"content\":\"2026-09-30\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"property\":\"article:author\",\"content\":\"DigiRobotics Research\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"name\":\"twitter:card\",\"content\":\"summary_large_image\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"name\":\"twitter:title\",\"content\":\"Why first-person video changes what robots can learn\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"12\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"A practical look at why viewpoint, intent, and task structure matter when human activity becomes training data for embodied systems.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"13\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico?63d5b2ef705d808e\",\"type\":\"image/x-icon\",\"sizes\":\"256x256\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"14\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/icon.png?1f3d5ce59ec9c445\",\"type\":\"image/png\",\"sizes\":\"1254x1254\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"15\",{\"rel\":\"apple-touch-icon\",\"href\":\"/apple-icon.png?1f3d5ce59ec9c445\",\"type\":\"image/png\",\"sizes\":\"1254x1254\"}],[\"$\",\"$L39\",\"16\",{}]]\n27:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-1\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"First-person, or egocentric, capture narrows that gap. It records a task closer to the perspective from which an embodied system will eventually perceive and plan it.\"}]\n28:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-0\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"Viewpoint is part of the data\"}]\n29:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-2\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"A camera angle is not cosmetic. It determines which relationships are visible: the distance from hand to tool, the moment a grip changes, and the sequence of attention across a workspace.\"}]\n2a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-3\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Useful egocentric data therefore needs more than a head-mounted camera. A collection plan should describe:\"}]\n2b:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-0\",{\"className\":\"my-6 space-y-3 pl-1 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"node\":{\"type\":\"element\",\"tagName\":\"li\",\"properties\":{},\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"the task and its intended outcome;\",\"position\":{\"start\":{\"line\":11,\"column\":3,\"offset\":735},\"end\":{\"line\":11,\"column\":37,\"offset\":769}}}],\"position\":{\"start\":{\"line\":11,\"column\":1,\"offset\":733},\"end\":{\"line\":11,\"column\":37,\"offset\":769}}},\"className\":\"relative pl-6 text-base leading-relaxed before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.72em] before:size-1.5 before:rounded-full before:bg-[var(--primary)]\",\"children\":\"the task and its intended outcome;\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"node\":{\"type\":\"element\",\"tagName\":\"li\",\"properties\":{},\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"the environment and relevant objects;\",\"position\":{\"start\":{\"line\":12,\"column\":3,\"offset\":772},\"end\":{\"line\":12,\"column\":40,\"offset\":809}}}],\"position\":{\"start\":{\"line\":12,\"column\":1,\"offset\":770},\"end\":{\"line\":12,\"column\":40,\"offset\":809}}},\"className\":\"relative pl-6 text-base leading-relaxed before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.72em] before:size-1.5 before:rounded-full before:bg-[var(--primary)]\",\"children\":\"the environment and relevant objects;\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-2\",{\"node\":{\"type\":\"element\",\"tagName\":\"li\",\"properties\":{},\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"the start, transition, and completion states;\",\"position\":{\"start\":{\"line\":13,\"column\":3,\"offset\":812},\"end\":{\"line\":13,\"column\":48,\"offset\":857}}}],\"position\":{\"start\":{\"line\":13,\"column\":1,\"offset\":810},\"end\":{\"line\":13,\"column\":48,\"offset\":857}}},\"className\":\"relative pl-6 text-base leading-relaxed before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.72em] before:size-1.5 before:rounded-full before:bg-[var(--primary)]\",\"children\":\"the start, transition, and completion states;\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-3\",{\"node\":{\"type\":\"element\",\"tagName\":\"li\",\"properties\":{},\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"interruptions, corrections, and failed attempts;\",\"position\":{\"start\":{\"line\":14,\"column\":3,\"offset\":860},\"end\":{\"line\":14,\"column\":51,\"offset\":908}}}],\"position\":{\"start\":{\"line\":14,\"column\":1,\"offset\":858},\"end\":{\"line\":14,\"column\":51,\"offset\":908}}},\"className\":\"relative pl-6 text-base leading-relaxed before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.72em] before:size-1.5 before:rounded-full before:bg-[var(--primary)]\",\"children\":\"interruptions, corrections, and failed attempts;\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-4\",{\"node\":{\"type\":\"element\",\"tagName\":\"li\",\"properties\":{},\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"consent, licensing, and privacy boundaries.\",\"position\":{\"start\":{\"line\":15,\"column\":3,\"offset\":911},\"end\":{\"line\":15,\"column\":46,\"offset\":954}}}],\"position\":{\"start\":{\"line\":15,\"column\":1,\"offset\":909},\"end\":{\"line\":15,\"column\":46,\"offset\":954}}},\"className\":\"relative pl-6 text-base leading-relaxed before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.72em] before:size-1.5 before:rounded-full before:bg-[var(--primary)]\",\"children\":\"consent, licensing, and privacy boundaries.\"}],\"\\n\"]}]\n2c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-4\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"The last point is foundational. A technically valuable recording can still be unusable if the people, screens, or locations inside it were captured without an appropriate basis for use.\"}]\n2d:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-1\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"Demonstrations are not instructions\"}]\n2e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-5\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"A recording shows what happened. It does not automatically explain why it happened.\"}]\n2f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-6\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Two visually similar hand movements may represent very different decisions. One person rotates a component to align a notch; another rotates it simply to see a label. Models benefit when video is paired with structured context such as task labels, object states, timestamps, and quality review.\"}]\n30:[\"$\",\"blockquote\",\"blockquote-0\",{\"className\":\"my-10 border-l-2 border-[var(--primary)] bg-[var(--primary)]/[0.06] px-6 py-2 font-heading text-xl leading-8 text-white sm:px-8\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"The goal is not to collect the most footage. It is to preserve the decisions that make the footage meaningful.\"}],\"\\n\"]}]\n31:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-2\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"Design for evaluation\"}]\n32:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-7\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"A dataset should make it possible to ask whether a system improved. That means holding out environments, performers, objects, or task variations rather than measuring performance only on familiar scenes.\"}]\n33:[\"$\",\"div\",\"table-0\",{\"className\":\"my-9 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-white/10\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full border-collapse text-left text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",\"thead-0\",{\"className\":\"bg-white/[0.05] font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--primary)]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",\"tr-0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",\"th-0\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-white/10 px-5 py-4 font-medium\",\"children\":\"Collection choice\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"th-1\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-white/10 px-5 py-4 font-medium\",\"children\":\"What it helps evaluate\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",\"tbody-0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"tr-0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-0\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-white/[0.07] px-5 py-4 leading-6 text-[var(--muted-foreground)] last:[tr:last-child_&]:border-b-0\",\"children\":\"Multiple performers\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-1\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-white/[0.07] px-5 py-4 leading-6 text-[var(--muted-foreground)] last:[tr:last-child_&]:border-b-0\",\"children\":\"Variation in technique and body geometry\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"tr-1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-0\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-white/[0.07] px-5 py-4 leading-6 text-[var(--muted-foreground)] last:[tr:last-child_&]:border-b-0\",\"children\":\"New workspaces\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-1\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-white/[0.07] px-5 py-4 leading-6 text-[var(--muted-foreground)] last:[tr:last-child_&]:border-b-0\",\"children\":\"Robustness to layout and lighting\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"tr-2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-0\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-white/[0.07] px-5 py-4 leading-6 text-[var(--muted-foreground)] last:[tr:last-child_&]:border-b-0\",\"children\":\"Failed attempts\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-1\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-white/[0.07] px-5 py-4 leading-6 text-[var(--muted-foreground)] last:[tr:last-child_&]:border-b-0\",\"children\":\"Recovery and error recognition\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"tr-3\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-0\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-white/[0.07] px-5 py-4 leading-6 text-[var(--muted-foreground)] last:[tr:last-child_&]:border-b-0\",\"children\":\"Explicit end states\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-1\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-white/[0.07] px-5 py-4 leading-6 text-[var(--muted-foreground)] last:[tr:last-child_&]:border-b-0\",\"children\":\"Task completion and verification\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]\n34:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-3\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"From capture to a durable asset\"}]\n35:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-8\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Provenance connects the recording to its contributor, capture brief, review history, and permitted uses. Storage and tokenization can help reference those records, but neither replaces a clear license or a reliable quality process.\"}]\n36:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-9\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"The durable asset is not merely a video file. It is a documented piece of evidence about how a real task unfolds—from a perspective a robot can use.\"}]\n37:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-16 border-t border-white/10 pt-8\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L26\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog\",\"className\":\"inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 px-5 py-3 text-[14px] font-semibold transition hover:border-[var(--primary)] hover:text-[var(--primary)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$La\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"icon\":\"$1e:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:icon\",\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"size\":16,\"aria-hid